  "label": "dehumanizing emotion",
  "description": "The emotion expressed is one of dehumanization, conveyed through the visual of a monkey being held affectionately by a man, juxtaposed with the text identifying the monkey as representing Michelle Obama. This creates a harmful emotional cue that equates a Black woman with an animal, stripping her of humanity and dignity. The man’s affectionate expression is ironically contrasted with the racist message, amplifying the emotional impact of the dehumanization.",
